{"id":"cazador","lemma":"cazador","pos":"noun","rank":2561,"glosses":["hunter","light infantryman","light cavalryman"],"ipa":"/kaθaˈdoɾ/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"cazadores","feminine":"cazadora","femininePlural":"cazadoras"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d3/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-cazador.wav","formAudio":{"cazadora":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/39/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-cazadora.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"El cazador disparó a un oso.","en":"The hunter shot a bear.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/57502","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to shoot, to fire","l":"disparar"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"bear"}]},{"text":"El cazador mató al zorro.","en":"The hunter killed the fox.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to kill, slay","l":"matar"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"fox"}]},{"text":"Algunos eran granjeros, algunos eran cazadores.","en":"Some were farmers, some were hunters.","words":[{"g":"someone","l":"alguno"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"farmer","l":"granjero"},{"g":"someone","l":"alguno"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"El cazador siguió las huellas del oso.","en":"The hunter followed the bear's tracks.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/526632","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to follow","l":"seguir"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"footprint","l":"huella"},{"g":"of the"},{"g":"bear"}]},{"text":"El ciervo fue abatido por cazadores.","en":"The deer was killed by hunters.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"deer, stag"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"abject, discouraged"},{"g":"for / by"},null]}]}